dex=\"0\" onclick=\"location.href = '/deals/bikes'\" onkeydown=\"if (event.key === 'Enter') location.href = '/deals/bikes'\">Bike deals of the week</span></p>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Example Shop, 2026</p></footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
